  "baseRefName": "main",
  "body": "Demonstration PR: deliberately adds a hard-coded API key to a config file, to show that the **secrets** gate (gitleaks) blocks it. The value was generated at random for this PR and never belonged to any service. (A first attempt with an AWS-style key pair was already refused by GitHub push protection at `git push`, before CI; see results/push-protection-aws-key.txt.) Not to be merged; it stays closed as evidence for the Lab 04 write-up.",
